file=Behavioural Science/DEPARTMENT-WORKFLOW.md · s:=Behaviour design \· framing \· experimentation \· bias + ethics review. Ethics-first: `bias` is the standing gate for `nudge` \· `frame` \· `trial` interventions.\n · st:=**Leader: `nudge`** (Simon + Fogg MAP identity). Others: `frame` \· `trial` \· `bias` — universal principles.\n · t:Tree=```\nTeams/Behavioural Science/\n├── README.md \· DEPARTMENT-WORKFLOW.md\n├── nudge/   (3 custom + Simon+Fogg identity)\n├── frame/   (3 custom)\n├── trial/   (3 custom)\n└── bias/    (3 custom — ethics gate)\n```\n\n12 skills \· 0 marketplace.\n · rr:Routing rules=- nudge routes design questions\n- **bias is the mandatory ethics gate** for every intervention shipping externally\n- Every experiment pre-registers analysis (no HARKing)\n- Sample sizing from `Shared OS/logical/sample_size.py`\n- Two Shared OS assets imported (mckee-story-structure.md, sample_size.py)\n · e:Escalation=L3 fixed to `Governance/board`. Always-L3:\n- nudge: dark-pattern-high in shipped product \· systemic perverse incentives\n- frame: framing that could mislead externally \· ethics-fail with no alternative\n- trial: adverse-event stopping-rule triggered \· vulnerable-population issue\n- bias: ethics-reject \· dark-pattern-high shipped \· adverse-event triggered\n · tb=\| Case \| We do \| They do \| · tb=\|---\|---\|---\| · tb=\| Experimentation execution \| design + interpret \| `Product/loom` executes online \| · tb=\| Field recruit \| design + brief \| `Market Intelligence/research` recruits \| · tb=\| Copy / voice \| frame message-level \| `Brand Studio/lena` + `weave` own copy \| · tb=\| Governance ethical checks \| our ethics review complements \| `Governance/sentinel` bypass detection \| · tb=\| Strategy pre-mortems \| facilitate \| `Executive Office/marcus` owns decision \| · f:Fleet=+4 (66 → 70). Routing rows added. **Fleet fully built.**\n